 Use the alternate colour scheme for the snake.  Shape identification using
 colour will be disabled.
 .TP 8
+.B \-\-viewer\-light | \-\-no\-viewer\-light
+.TP 8
+.B \-\-lamp\-light | \-\-no\-lamp\-light
+.TP 8
+.B \-\-sun\-light | \-\-no\-sun\-light
+The second light can be at the viewer, a lamp above the snake, or the sun
+shining from the same direction.  Those switched on take turns, the next one
+with each new shape; one switched on stays.  All three are on by default, and
+with none on all three take turns.
+.TP 8
 .B -angvel \fIangular\fP
 Change the speed at which the snake morphs to a new shape.
